basic.description:
{Basic Reinforcements}

Summons creatures from the garrison of the nearest friendly town.

May be cast twice per day.

advanced.description:
{Advanced Reinforcements}

Summons creatures from the garrison of any friendly town.

May be cast three times per day.

expert.description:
{Expert Reinforcements}

Summons creatures from the garrison of any friendly town.

May be cast four times per day.
